review_notes = "Strong cast/formwork concrete with credible tie holes and panel joints. Good structural-language material, but strongly dependent on element size and composition. Prefer small/medium structural spans, beams, columns, reveals, ceiling areas, or wall areas whose composition breaks repetition. Do not assume it is appropriate for a very large uninterrupted wall with most of its surface exposed; room-level review must confirm repetition remains acceptable."
